  "transcript": "Welcome to Tabuk Pharma. At Tabuk Pharma, we believe meaningful transformation is driven by people, and today our journey becomes stronger with you. Since 1994, we have grown into a leading pharmaceutical company in the MENA region, guided by quality, innovation and our commitment to improving lives through healthcare. As healthcare evolves, we see new opportunities to lead, innovate and create lasting impact. Aligned with the Saudi Vision in 2030, we are building a more agile, future ready and innovation driven company to better serve patients and communities. As you begin your journey with us, remember that every contribution matters and every idea has the power to create value. Together, we are shaping the future of the healthcare. Welcome to Tabooq Pharma.",
